  "content": "\n\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>Alien Evo Plumbers <span style=\"color:#fff\">v1.0.0</span></strong></span></pre>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>Особенности:</strong></span></h3>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">- <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">Костюм «Сантехник V1»</span> <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">доступен</span></span></strong></h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">- Нажмите «<span style=\"color:#fff\">X</span>» с полным комплектом <span style=\"color:#fff\">«Сантехник V1»</span>, чтобы использовать свою </span></strong><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">способн</span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">ость</span></span></strong></h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">-&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#fff\">Планшет «Главное управление»</span> теперь <span style=\"color:#fff\">можно создать</span></span></strong></h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">- <span style=\"color:#fff\">Планшет «Самоуничтожение»</span> теперь <span style=\"color:#fff\">можно создать</span></span></strong></h4>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>Крафт:</strong></span></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"font-size:16px\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4b257317-5654-40c1-9a5b-6eb2ab040d0a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"189\" height=\"95\"></h3>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_38b64454-80fc-478a-8ebc-4f10292fbe45.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"180\" height=\"95\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a731fb9e-592a-472d-b1f3-c89d57ffbf1f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"186\" height=\"95\"></h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_81f943ca-9564-4a55-88dd-675803543858.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"181\" height=\"95\"></span></span></strong><img style=\"font-size:16px\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_80706a53-6f10-41ff-a2e1-4b5fde0f6788.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"192\" height=\"95\"></h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d8283958-c2b4-454d-a469-3e175fda25b1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"179\" height=\"95\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_91112219-d160-4ca7-a50c-ea3c9a581b80.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"179\" height=\"95\"></h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_81047c0a-678e-4815-9d9a-6b85f76c04f0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"177\" height=\"95\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1d2d98b7-1f24-4758-b167-1c75193a383d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"179\" height=\"95\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>Скриншоты:</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7f6c13c8-9959-4838-a296-34e21928370d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"360\" height=\"360\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_391fe091-3bcf-4361-9208-310a0413aea0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"360\" height=\"360\"></strong></span></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">Требования:</span></strong></h3>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h5>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alienevo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alien Evolution,</a><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/threetag-palladium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;Palladium</a></span></h4>",
